# Every text file is checked out with LF endings on every OS. The evidence
# manifests (sim/fixtures/*/manifest.json) record SHA-256s of the recorded
# inputs and raw artifacts as LF bytes, so a checkout must reproduce those
# bytes exactly -- and a CRLF shell script fails to parse on Linux/macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.onnx binary
*.elf binary
